<setup>

  <selectFromSequence name = "pm" from = "-1" to = "1" step = "2"/>
  <selectFromSequence name = "m" from = "-3/2" to = "3/2" step = "1/2" exclude="-1 0 1"/>
  <selectFromSequence name = "k" from = "-2" to = "2" step = "1" exclude="-$m 0 $m"/>
  <selectFromSequence name = "a" from = "1" to = "2" step = "1"/>
  <selectFromSequence name = "b" from = "4" to = "6" step = "1"/>
  
  <function name="f">$m*x + $k</function>
  <function name="F">$m/2*x^2 + $k*x</function>
  
</setup>

<p>
    Let <m>f(x) = $f</m> and consider <m>f(x)</m> on the interval <m>[$a,$b]</m>.
</p>

<p>
  Plot a graph of <m>f(x)</m> on the interval <m>[$a,$b]</m> and sketch the region the function bounds along with the <m>x</m>-axis.
</p>

<p>
  Reason graphically and geometrically to determine the exact value of each of the following quantities.
</p>

<p>
  <ol marker="a.">
    <li>
      <p>
        <m>\displaystyle \int_{$a}^{$b} f(x) \, dx = </m><answer>$$F($b)-$$F($a)</answer>
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        The average value of <m>f</m> on the interval <m>[$a,$b]</m>, <m>f_{\small{\text{AVG}[$a,$b]}}</m>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <m>f_{\small{\text{AVG}[$a,$b]}}=</m> <answer allowedErrorInNumbers="0.01" allowedErrorIsAbsolute>($$F($b)-$$F($a))/($b-$a)</answer>
      </p>
    </li>  

  </ol>
</p>